 "description": "Bianca2013 - Persistence analysis in a Kolmogorov-type model for cancer-immune system competition\nBioModels BIOMD0000000900 (curated). SBML file: Bianca2013.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 4000 time units (SED-ML: Bianca2013.sedml), sampling 4.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 1.40e-05 of species peak (worst: T)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Removal_of_cancer_cell_by_the_action_of_B_cell_and_T_cell term 1/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Removal_of_cancer_cell_by_the_action_of_B_cell_and_T_cell term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): T1 = T",
